                                "sense_id": "279f53a0-0cca-3eba-be92-5fcd256db18a",
                                "text": "The only sail that is wholly ours is the spanker. They control absolutely--sheets, halyards, clewlines, buntlines, braces, and down-hauls--every sail on the fore and main. We control the braces on the mizzen, although they control the canvas on the mizzen."
